### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Urban Road with Dogs Running Across" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Dog running across the road" .
:actor2 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Second dog running across the road" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low visibility due to nighttime" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Dogs moving unpredictably across the road" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of collision with dogs crossing the road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of occlusion due to parked vehicles and low visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

